    "text": "\"You have packaged nearly everything else.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 204,
    "text": "\"I know.\"",
    "occurrence": 2
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 205,
    "text": "\"Eleven years at East Four became Tuesdays, wages, meals, shoes, and one woman stealing a potato.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 206,
    "text": "\"A brother who no longer knew you became one conversation in a room. A marriage you insist on describing through ledgers became bread, work, disagreement, and signatures. Two children became sleep, cloth, cups, pencils, coins, and arguments over trousers.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 207,
    "text": "\"You compress aggressively. Often badly. Sometimes dishonestly. But you compress.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 208,
    "text": "\"Thank you.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 209,
    "text": "\"That was not praise.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 210,
    "text": "\"Everyone has learned that sentence.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 211,
    "text": "\"Now you cannot choose the container.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 212,
    "text": "\"Maybe there isn't one.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 213,
    "text": "\"Perhaps.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 214,
    "text": "\"Helpful.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 215,
    "text": "\"You have spent four days attempting to demonstrate that experience has structure. Cause. Choice. consequence. Revision. You select what belongs together and call the selection an account.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 216,
    "text": "\"That is what people do.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 217,
    "text": "\"Yes.\"",
    "occurrence": 10
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 218,
    "text": "\"So?\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 219,
    "text": "\"So perhaps the failure is information.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 220,
    "text": "\"About what?\"",
    "occurrence": 2
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 221,
    "text": "\"You.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 222,
    "text": "\"You have used the other life as a measuring instrument since you arrived.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 223,
    "text": "\"What?\"",
    "occurrence": 2
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 224,
    "text": "\"When this body disappoints you, you compare it to the first. When your choices surprise you, you compare them to the first. When a person differs from your memory, the first life becomes evidence. When your knowledge exceeds this life's experience, the first life becomes explanation.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 225,
    "text": "\"It is explanation.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 226,
    "text": "\"Sometimes.\"",
    "occurrence": 2
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 227,
    "text": "\"I was there.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 228,
    "text": "\"That is your claim.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 229,
    "text": "\"We are still on that?\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 230,
    "text": "\"We are on everything.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 231,
    "text": "\"You call the man S-class. You call him support. You say he never married. You say he never had children. You say he kept leaving. You say he knew Nhal. You say this body remembers what his could do.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 232,
    "text": "\"You have used him to explain this life repeatedly.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 233,
    "text": "\"You have not told me what he thought he was doing.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 234,
    "text": "\"That is cheap,\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 235,
    "text": "\"What is?\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 236,
    "text": "\"Changing the subject until I can talk.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 237,
    "text": "\"I changed the direction.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 238,
    "text": "\"Same thing.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 239,
    "text": "\"No.\"",
    "occurrence": 8
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 240,
    "text": "\"Feels the same.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 241,
    "text": "\"Also not the same.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 242,
    "text": "\"You think because I can talk about First Life, that's where we should go.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 243,
    "text": "\"I think language returned.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 244,
    "text": "\"You noticed.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 245,
    "text": "\"Yes.\"",
    "occurrence": 11
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 246,
    "text": "\"Immediately.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 247,
    "text": "\"Yes.\"",
    "occurrence": 12
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 248,
    "text": "\"Fuck you.\"",
    "occurrence": 4
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 249,
    "text": "\"That phrase also remains available.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 250,
    "text": "\"Fine.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 251,
    "text": "\"Not fine. Temporary.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 252,
    "text": "\"We go backward until I can figure out why forward stopped working.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 253,
    "text": "\"You assume the reason is behind you.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 254,
    "text": "\"I assume talking is better than staring at each other until one of us dies.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 255,
    "text": "\"That outcome favors me.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 256,
    "text": "\"Exactly.\"",
    "occurrence": 2
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 257,
    "text": "\"Where?\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 258,
    "text": "\"Where what?\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 259,
    "text": "\"If we go backward, where do you begin?\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 260,
    "text": "\"Do not.\"",
    "occurrence": 2
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 261,
    "text": "\"You are doing the face.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 262,
    "text": "\"I have one face.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 263,
    "text": "\"Untrue.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 264,
    "text": "\"Begin.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 265,
    "text": "\"Barrier.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 266,
    "text": "\"Cheap utility spell. Everybody knew somebody who knew it. Dust. Rain. Splashes. Wound covers. Keeping things on one side of a boundary.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 267,
    "text": "\"It wasn't impressive. Half the reason people learned it had nothing to do with combat.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 268,
    "text": "\"Why did you?\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  },
  {
    "quote_index": 269,
    "text": "\"I learned Barrier because I didn't want to get anyone pregnant.\"",
    "occurrence": 1
  }
